        <activityName xml:lang="en">Sulphate pulp, from eucalyptus ssp. (SFM), unbleached, TH, at maritime harbour</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Sulphate pulp, from eucalyptus ssp. (SFM), unbleached, TH, at maritime harbour
data refers to pulp from Thailand, used in Europe.;
UUID: 650c4f2a-9706-3dd2-b844-9983abd762e3
includes transportation of the pulp from the pulp mill in Thailand to a main harbour in Europe by truck and freight ship. Main ports in Europe include Rotterdam, Hamburg, Bremerhafen or Antwerpen.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: assumes average European technology
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: see Technology and Geography
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_650c4f2a-9706-3dd2-b844-9983abd762e3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
